bschemes）<MATHSEG_0002>使得<MATHSEG_0003>是平坦（flat）的<MATHSEG_0004>闭子集（closed subsets）<MATHSEG_0005>对泛化（generalizations）封闭<MATHSEG_0006>\n若<MATH_0003>是这样的闭子概形（closed subscheme），则任一态射（morphism）<MATH_0004>，只要它在概形（schemes）之间且在集合（set）意义下满足<MATH_0005>，就可在概形（scheme）意义下经由<MATH_0006>分解（factors）。\n", "translation_hash": "sha256:8de171111da7779908c82805326c4d4014b7de535548647e19da602de1c88b74", "unit_id": "tag:04PW:statement", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "引理中给定的几何对象。", "source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"context": "对应规则所取的对象。", "source_term": "closed subscheme", "target_term": "闭子概形"}, {"context": "对应规则所得的底层子集。", "source_term": "closed subset", "target_term": "闭子集"}, {"context": "对应规则给出的双向一一对应。", "source_term": "bijection", "target_term": "双射"}, {"context": "双射左侧对象的复数形式。", "source_term": "closed subschemes", "target_term": "闭子概形"}, {"context": "双射左侧要求的性质。", "source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}, {"context": "双射右侧对象的复数形式。", "source_term": "closed subsets", "target_term": "闭子集"}, {"context": "双射右侧的闭子集须对此关系封闭。", "source_term": "generalizations", "target_term": "泛化"}, {"context": "末句承接前述条件的对象。", "source_term": "closed subscheme", "target_term": "闭子概形"}, {"context": "末句量化的映射。", "source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"context": "末句态射的源和目标所属的对象类型。", "source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"context": "限定末句中条件成立的意义。", "source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"context": "限定末句中分解成立的意义。", "source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"context": "表示态射经由指定的闭子概形。", "source_term": "factors", "target_term": "分解"}]}
